  "html": "<main class=\"page-products\">\n    <!-- ===== Hero ===== -->\n    <section class=\"prod-hero container\" data-stagger>\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"margin-bottom:18px\">For Operations &amp; Sales Teams</p>\n      <h1 class=\"prod-hero__title\">Inventory + Sales<br>Dashboard</h1>\n      <p class=\"prod-hero__sub\">One dashboard for stock, sales and channel performance, built to answer the questions your team asks every day</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"container\" style=\"padding-bottom: clamp(48px, 6vw, 96px)\">\n      <div class=\"prod-hero__media reveal\">\n        <img src=\"/assets/img/products/isd-overview.webp\" alt=\"Dashboard overview showing revenue, orders, completed orders, units sold, average order value and repeat rate KPI tiles above a monthly revenue trend chart\">\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- ===== Features ===== -->\n    <section class=\"section container\" style=\"padding-top: 0\">\n      <div class=\"prod-head reveal\">\n        <h2>Inventory + Sales Dashboard</h2>\n        <p>Stock levels, sales performance and channel mix in one place, so decisions don't wait for someone to build a spreadsheet.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"feat-grid\" data-stagger>\n        <article class=\"feat-card\">\n          <span class=\"feat-card__ico\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <svg width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M3 3v18h18\"/><path d=\"M7 15V9M12 15V6M17 15v-4\"/></svg>\n          </span>\n          <div>\n            <h3>Live Sales Overview</h3>\n            <p>Revenue, orders, units and average order value in one glance, compared automatically against the same period last year.</p>\n          </div>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"feat-card\">\n          <span class=\"feat-card__ico\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <svg width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 7 12 3 4 7v10l8 4 8-4V7Z\"/><path d=\"M4 7l8 4 8-4M12 11v10\"/></svg>\n          </span>\n          <div>\n            <h3>Inventory &amp; Stock Signals</h3>\n            <p>See what's low, what's overstocked and what needs reordering, ranked by product, before it turns into a stock-out or dead stock.</p>\n          </div>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"feat-card\">\n          <span class=\"feat-card__ico\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <svg width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\" rx=\"1\"/><rect x=\"14\" y=\"3\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\" rx=\"1\"/><rect x=\"3\" y=\"14\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\" rx=\"1\"/><rect x=\"14\" y=\"14\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\" rx=\"1\"/></svg>\n          </span>\n          <div>\n            <h3>Channel Performance</h3>\n            <p>Compare direct sale, online, partner and paid channels side by side, and see what each one actually leaves after cost, not just top-line revenue.</p>\n          </div>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"feat-card\">\n          <span class=\"feat-card__ico\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <svg width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 21s-7-6.2-7-11a7 7 0 0 1 14 0c0 4.8-7 11-7 11z\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"2.5\"/></svg>\n          </span>\n          <div>\n            <h3>Geography Breakdown</h3>\n            <p>A live map of where orders come from, down to the city, so you know which markets are growing and which need attention.</p>\n          </div>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"feat-card\">\n          <span class=\"feat-card__ico\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <svg width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"8\" r=\"3.2\"/><path d=\"M2.5 19c0-3 3-5 6.5-5s6.5 2 6.5 5\"/><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"8.5\" r=\"2.4\"/><path d=\"M15.7 13.8c2.7.4 4.8 2.1 4.8 4.7\"/></svg>\n          </span>\n          <div>\n            <h3>Team &amp; Network Activity</h3>\n            <p>Track field teams or partner networks over time: who's active, who joined, who's gone quiet, and where to follow up first.</p>\n          </div>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"feat-card\">\n          <span class=\"feat-card__ico\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <svg width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 3v13\"/><path d=\"m7 12 5 5 5-5\"/><path d=\"M4 20h16\"/></svg>\n          </span>\n          <div>\n            <h3>Filterable, Exportable Reports</h3>\n            <p>Every view filters by date, region, category and channel, and exports cleanly, so a board update stops being a half-day job.</p>\n          </div>\n        </article>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"preview\">\n        <div class=\"reveal\">\n          <p class=\"eyebrow\">Product Preview</p>\n          <h3 class=\"preview__title\">Where your orders come from</h3>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"preview__frame reveal\">\n          <img src=\"/assets/img/products/isd-geography.webp\" alt=\"Geography panel: an India map shaded by revenue with metro pins, beside ranked bar lists of top metros and states outside the metros\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"preview\">\n        <div class=\"reveal\">\n          <p class=\"eyebrow\">Product Preview</p>\n          <h3 class=\"preview__title\">Channel performance and